    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches are delighted to present to market No. 18 Olcovar, a generously proportioned 3 bedroom duplex tastefully decorated and improved by its current owners to present a bright walk-in ready home.\r\n\r\nOlcovar is one of the most sought after developments located in one of South Dublin’s most popular suburbs Shankill. A mature mixed development highly maintained and looked after with ample visitors parking 1 designated space.\r\n\r\nTo front this property has stair access to the front door, then on the first floor includes a large central landing with storage, main bathroom with bath, two double bedrooms to the rear with fitted wardrobes and south facing views over green trees. The primary double bedroom includes fitted wardrobes and an ensuite with shower and access to a large balcony. \r\n\r\nUpstairs includes the main living spaces; a bright central landing leads to the third bathroom with shower and access to a storage area. The living space is open plan, a generous living room with large glass windows, dining area off the kitchen with access to the second balcony perfect for al fresco dining. The modern fitted kitchen includes ample storage and workspace with Velux window above allowing south facing light to flood the living area.\r\n\r\nOlcovar is only a brisk walk away from Shankill village and all of its associated amenities such as boutique shops, cafes, pubs, Tesco Express, Centra, Lidl and a pharmacy. Killiney beach, Shankill beach, many green and park areas are also just a stroll away. There is also an abundance of highly regarded primary, secondary, pre/after schools in the area. \r\n\r\nTransport links include the N11 dual carriageway along with the M50 interchange just a few minutes away, Shankill DART only a short walk away (20min), numerous Dublin bus routes to the city centre and the Aircoach for direct access to the airport is also close at hand.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
