        "Content": "Living Room/ Dining Area:                                                                                                          c.   5.76 x 5.15m\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen:                                                                                                                                       c.   2.78 x 2.64m\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room:                                                                                                                                c.    2 x 1.96m\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:                                                                                                                                 c.     4.22 x 4.60m         (to front)\r\n\r\n            En-Suite:                                                                                                                                  c.     2.77 x 1.72m \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:                                                                                                                                 c.      4.61 x 2.83m\t   (to rear)\r\n \r\n\r\nBedroom 3:                                                                                                                                 c.      3.78 x 2.80m        (to rear)\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom:                                                                                                                                   c.      2.47 x 1.72m"
